ull},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-05-31T22:59:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:26:32Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.1 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21043.5001) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-10105F CPU @ 3.70GHz (8 threads) - 15.87 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nInvalid Motion Vectors are generated when an object stops moving.\n\nIn this image the camera is attached to the sphere, and the frame that the sphere stops moving suddenly these motion vectors pop out, and TAA and FSR show problems on the edges when that happens\n\n<img width=\"417\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94687158-35d8-45e8-a333-d8b2d19cdb18\" />\n\nIn the case where the camera isn't attached to the sphere, and the sphere stops moving, you see the motion vectors linger for a frame, but they otherwise look as if the sphere moved normally that frame, and AA also suffers in this scenario\n\nThis latter setup can also be simulated by moving the camera instead of the sphere, in which case everything works as expected.\n\nFurther more this seems to cause the elusive TAA edge problem that has been a long standing issue I've had with Godot's TAA which led to me abandoning work on it, given that in the sphere motion case the edges go crazy when the sphere stops but in the camera motion case they remain fine\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThere are 2 scenes, one where the camera is moving with the sphere, and one where the sphere is moving on away from the camera.\n\nIn both there is an issue with the last Frame's Motion Vectors being nonsense.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MV.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28446080/MV.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119925/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}